Recommends: libpam-systemd
Description: GXDE lock screen for X11 and Wayland
 gxde-lock is the in-session screen locker of GXDE OS, split out of the GXDE
 Display Manager. It provides a classic DTK widget lock screen and a modern
 Qt Quick one, both working on X11 and on Wayland (ext-session-lock-v1 or
 LayerShellQt), with PAM password and fingerprint unlock.
